<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαι-εύομαι</span></b> , (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			) <i>serve as a midwife, act as one</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἄρτεμις μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DDeor.</u>
					26.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause delivery to take place</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκανὴ ἔκπληξις μαιεύσασθαι πρὸ τῆς
					ὥρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>bring to the birth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marin.
				<u>Procl.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθας μ.</span>
			<i>hatch</i> chickens, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰετὸν κάνθαρος
			μαιεύσομαι</span>, prov. of taking vengeance on a powerful
			enemy, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				695
			</span></i> (cf. Sch.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>deliver</i> a woman, esp. metaph. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> of the Socratic method, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				149b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.208
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.506
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑπ᾽ ἐμοῦ μαιευθέντα</span>
			<i>brought into the world</i> by me, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				150e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				5.13
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
